{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1989_q001", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1989", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1989, "question_number": 1, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 21, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极限", "变上限积分", "导数定义", "积分方程", "连续性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1989_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1989_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q001.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png"], "answer": "(1) $1/2$；(2) $\\pi$；(3) $y=2x$；(4) $n!$；(5) $x-1$；(6) $a=b$；(7) $\\dfrac{dx}{(x+y)^2}$", "explanation": "各小题分别用基本极限、分部积分、变上限积分求导、导数定义、设积分常数、连续性条件和隐函数微分即可得到。", "methods": ["分部积分", "隐函数求导", "变限积分求导"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1989_q002", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1989", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1989, "question_number": 2, "question_type": "solution", "score": 20, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["不定积分", "极限", "参数方程", "二阶导数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1989_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1989_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q002.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png"], "answer": "(1) $y'=-\\dfrac{e^{-\\sqrt{x}}}{2\\sqrt{x}\\sqrt{1-e^{-2\\sqrt{x}}}}$；(2) $-\\dfrac{1}{\\ln x}+C$；(3) $e^2$；(4) $\\dfrac{dy}{dx}=\\dfrac{1}{2t}$，$\\dfrac{d^2y}{dx^2}=-\\dfrac{1+t^2}{4t^3}$；(5) $0$", "explanation": "第一问直接作复合函数求导。第二问令 $u=\\ln x$。第三问取对数转化为熟悉极限。第四问用参数方程求导公式。第五问分部积分并换元后代入已知条件。", "methods": ["复合函数求导", "分部积分", "参数方程求导", "求导公式"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1989_q003", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1989", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1989, "question_number": 3, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 18, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["渐近线", "单调性", "方程根的个数", "旋转体体积", "极值", "常系数线性微分方程", "可导性", "导数定义"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1989_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1989_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q003.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png", "images/source_pages/page_002.png"], "answer": "(1) A；(2) B；(3) C；(4) D；(5) B；(6) D", "explanation": "(1) 当 $x\\to+\\infty$ 时，$\\sin\\frac{1}{x}\\sim\\frac{1}{x}$，故 $x\\sin\\frac{1}{x}\\to1$，有且仅有水平渐近线 $y=1$，选 A。\n\n(2) 设\n$$\nP(x)=x^5+2ax^3+3bx+4c.\n$$\n则\n$$\nP'(x)=5x^4+6ax^2+3b.\n$$\n把 $x^2$ 看作变量时，其判别式为\n$$\n\\Delta=(6a)^2-4\\cdot5\\cdot3b=12(3a^2-5b)<0.\n$$\n又首项系数为正，所以 $P'(x)>0$ 恒成立，$P(x)$ 严格递增，方程有唯一实根，选 B。\n\n(3) 旋转体体积为\n$$\nV=\\pi\\int_{-\\pi/2}^{\\pi/2}\\cos^2x\\,dx=\\frac{\\pi^2}{2},\n$$\n选 C。\n\n(4) 两个函数都在 $x=a$ 处取得极大值时，乘积是否取极值还与函数值符号有关，不能确定，选 D。\n\n(5) 方程 $y''-y=e^x+1$ 的齐次特征根为 $\\pm1$，$e^x$ 与齐次解共振，因此对应特解应乘以 $x$；常数项取常数特解即可，选 $axe^x+b$，即 B。\n\n(6)\n$$\n\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(a)-f(a-h)}{h}\n=\\lim_{t\\to0}\\frac{f(a+t)-f(a)}{t}\\quad(t=-h),\n$$\n该极限存在正是导数存在的充分条件，选 D。", "methods": ["隐函数求导"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1989_q004", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1989", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1989, "question_number": 4, "question_type": "solution", "score": 6, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["一阶线性微分方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1989_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1989_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q004.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_002.png"], "answer": "$y=\\dfrac{e^x}{x}(e^x-e)$", "explanation": "化为标准形式 $y'+(1/x-1)y=e^{2x}/x$，积分因子为 $xe^{-x}$。求出通解后代入条件 $y(1)=0$ 即得。", "methods": ["积分因子"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1989_q005", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1989", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1989, "question_number": 5, "question_type": "solution", "score": 7, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["积分方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1989_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1989_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q005.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_002.png"], "answer": "$f(x)=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\sin x+\\dfrac{x}{2}\\cos x$", "explanation": "对原式连续求导两次，可得 $f''(x)+f(x)=-\\sin x$。又由原式可知 $f(0)=0$、$f'(0)=1$，解该初值问题即可。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1989_q006", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1989", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1989, "question_number": 6, "question_type": "solution", "score": 7, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["零点个数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1989_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1989_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q006.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_002.png"], "answer": "在 $(0,+\\infty)$ 内有且仅有两个不同实根。", "explanation": "设 $k=\\int_0^\\pi\\sqrt{1-\\cos2x}\\,dx>0$，令 $F(x)=\\ln x-x/e+k$。则 $F'(x)=1/x-1/e$，故在 $(0,e)$ 上递增，在 $(e,+\\infty)$ 上递减；且 $F(e)=k>0$，两端都趋于 $-\\infty$，因此各区间内恰有一个零点。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1989_q007", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1989", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1989, "question_number": 7, "question_type": "solution", "score": 11, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["函数作图"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1989_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1989_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q007.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_002.png"], "answer": "单调减区间：$(-\\infty,-2)\\cup(0,+\\infty)$；单调增区间：$(-2,0)$；极值点：$x=-2$；极值：$y=-1/4$；凹区间：$(-3,0)\\cup(0,+\\infty)$；凸区间：$(-\\infty,-3)$；拐点：$(-3,-2/9)$；渐近线：$x=0,\\ y=0$", "explanation": "将函数写成 $y=1/x+1/x^2$，由 $y'$ 判单调，由 $y''$ 判凹凸与拐点。$x=0$ 为竖直渐近线，$y=0$ 为水平渐近线。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1989_q008", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1989", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1989, "question_number": 8, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["最优化", "积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1989_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1989_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q008.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_002.png"], "answer": "$a=-\\dfrac{5}{4}$，$b=\\dfrac{3}{2}$，$c=0$", "explanation": "由过原点知 $c=0$。面积条件给出 $a/3+b/2=1/3$，从而可把 $b$ 表为 $a$ 的函数。再把体积 $V=\\pi\\int_0^1(ax^2+bx)^2dx$ 化为关于 $a$ 的函数，求导可得极小点 $a=-5/4$，回代得 $b=3/2$。", "methods": []}
